# Ignore list for apps/electron/Dockerfile.build (BuildKit prefers
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the root .dockerignore).
#
# A dedicated list is required: the root .dockerignore excludes `apps/electron`
# and every `dist/`, both of which the electron build needs.
#
# Strategy is deny-all then re-include, so a new unrelated top-level directory
# cannot silently inflate the build context. Order matters — later patterns win.
*

# Workspace root manifests. pnpm-workspace.yaml names its members explicitly, so
# `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` needs every member's package.json.
!package.json
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!.npmrc
!**/package.json

# The app itself, including ui-active staged by `make electron-ui-copy`.
!apps/electron

# Never ship dependency trees or previous output, even from the re-includes above.
**/node_modules
apps/electron/release
apps/electron/dist
apps/electron/certs/*.key
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
